        "created_at": "2014-03-29T17:12:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Gauge is a nice combo for card setup with Updated Intel. &nbsp;I have found sometimes with using Updated Intel on hero decks it becomes a bit pointless if the card on bottom isn't worth putting on top. &nbsp; Having both in play gives more options for setting up any hero deck. &nbsp;</p>",
